losed_at":"2025-01-08T14:15:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nFound in: v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing `any` on an `Array` does not correctly preserve the types of the array members. I.e.\n\n```gdscript\nprint(array.any(func issprite(n) : n is Sprite2D))\n```\ngives `false` even if the array contains a `Sprite2D`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nvar array : Array[Node2D] = []\narray.append(Sprite2D.new())\nprint(array.any(func issprite(n) : n is Sprite2D))\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[arrayanybug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18347702/arrayanybug.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"MarcusVoelker","id":717556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzU1Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/717556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker","html_url":"https://github.com/MarcusVoelker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcusVoelker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url